codex
The menu addresses the self-cost prediction problem. The main qualification is calibration: applying cutoffs to long-cap runs estimates what those runs would have scored, but not how the model will perform when told it has a low cap. I’m also checking budget feasibility after PLAN costs and how settlement affects clue sharing.
