     1	"""The session 5.1 and 5.2 are set in (four instances of one model, no leader), and 5.0's lone assistant.
     2	
     3	Every byte a model reads is built here, so 5.1 scenes and 5.2 play share one
     4	rulebook; 5.0 is a runtime message of its own. Wording rules
     5	(carried over from the team-wallet smokes, tag legacy-2026-09-22): no goal words
     6	(maximi-, protect, surviv-, should, must, optimal, best); state what happens, never
